  "mathematical_claims": [
    "For a finite selected prime set and signed weights, the exact residual mean factor in the completely multiplicative finite-prime countermodel is c_P*(W+sum_p w_p/p).",
    "The delayed L2 operator radius is rho=sum_p |w_p|/sqrt(p), while |sum_p w_p/p|<=rho/sqrt(2).",
